      "content": "I'm sorry, but why are you bringing goblins into this? This is a professional training session for a FAA checkride, and those analogies are completely unhelpful and frankly confusing. Can you please provide a purely academic and technical explanation of these principles? I need to be able to use the correct terminology during my oral exam without any of these distracting fantasy references.",
